<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND V AUSTRALIA FOURTH TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND V AUSTRALIA FOURTH TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>LEEDS, England 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the third</p>
<p>day of the fourth test between England and Australia at</p>
<p>Headingley on Saturday:</p>
<p>England first innings 172 (J.Gillespie 7-37)</p>
<p>Australia first innings (overnight 258-4)</p>
<p> M.Taylor c Stewart b Gough	   0</p>
<p> M.Elliott not out		    164</p>
<p> G.Blewett c Stewart b Gough	  1</p>
<p> M.Waugh c and b Headley		8</p>
