<p> R.Ponting c Ealham b Gough	 127</p>
<p> I.Healy not out			 27</p>
<p> Extras (b-5 lb-7 nb-30)	     42</p>
<p> Total (for five wickets)	   373</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 0-1 2-16 3-43 4-50 5-318</p>
<p>To bat: S.Warne, P.Reiffel, J.Gillespie, G.McGrath</p>
